---
// Panel con borde de la referencia ("Facturación electrónica con la DIAN"), aquí: integración con la historia clínica.
---

<section class="section-padding" aria-labelledby="his-title">
  <div class="container-custom grid items-center gap-12 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card px-6 py-10 sm:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr] lg:px-12 lg:py-12">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow mb-4">De la agenda a la historia clínica</p>
      <h2 id="his-title" class="display-lg text-ink">
        Interoperabilidad <span class="tone">con tu HIS.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-lg text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Conecta GEN.AI con tu software de historia clínica mediante API REST y evita la doble digitación.
        También se integra con Google Calendar, Outlook y sistemas personalizados.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-ink">
        {['Conexión vía API REST', 'Sin doble digitación', 'Agendamiento más rápido'].map((t) => (
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m5 12 4 4 10-10" /></svg>
            {t}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <a href="/solucion/" class="group mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-ink">
        Conoce cómo funciona
        <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-accent/60 text-accent transition-colors group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-[var(--on-accent)]" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9" /></svg>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto h-72 w-full max-w-md" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 aspect-square rounded-full border border-dashed border-line"></div>
      <div class="absolute top-10 left-0 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-4 py-3 rotate-[-4deg]">
        <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/15 text-accent">
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 10h8M8 14h5m-9 6 2.5-3H18a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14Z" /></svg>
        </span>
        <div>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-muted">Desde WhatsApp</p>
          <p class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink">Cita registrada</p>
        </div>
        <svg class="ml-2 h-4 w-4 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m5 12 4 4 10-10" /></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="absolute top-6 right-2 w-60 rotate-[4deg] rounded-xl border border-line bg-[var(--bg)] p-5 shadow-[var(--shadow)]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <img src="/logo-96.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" class="h-7 w-7 rounded-full" loading="lazy" />
          <p class="text-sm font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink">GEN.AI</p>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] text-muted uppercase">Sincronización con HIS</p>
        <div class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-[11px]">
          <p class="flex justify-between border-b border-line pb-2 text-muted">Paciente <span class="text-ink">Actualizado</span></p>
          <p class="flex justify-between border-b border-line pb-2 text-muted">Cita <span class="text-ink">Registrada</span></p>
          <p class="flex justify-between text-muted">Profesional <span class="text-ink">Asignado</span></p>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 rounded-md bg-accent/15 px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-accent">Sin doble digitación</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
